# Replace this file with your actual Cosign public key.
# Generate with: cosign generate-key-pair
# Copy cosign.pub here and to docs/public/keys/cosign.pub
#
# Then add the SHA-256 hash of this file as a repository secret:
#   sha256sum .github/keys/cosign.pub
#   → Settings → Secrets → Actions → TRUSTED_COSIGN_KEY_HASH
